  "content": "\n\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组目前处于测试阶段；可能会存在漏洞或部分功能尚未完善，敬请谅解。</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong><em>已知无兼容性问题（崩溃）</em></strong></p>\n<p>Doomsday Functionality 是一款为“Doomsday Decoration”添加的大部分装饰物品提供战利品拾取功能的模组。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可自定义所有战利品刷新时间</li>\n<li>基于数据包的战利品表</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>如需报告漏洞或加入 Discord 交流娱乐，请访问：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVd6GNpvtW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/PVd6GNpvtW</a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>开发计划：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>添加按方块独立的刷新计时器</strong></li>\n<li><strong>添加配置项以启用或禁用特定可拾取物品</strong></li>\n<li><strong>尝试修复大型方块的实际碰撞箱问题</strong></li>\n<li><strong>实现点击大型载具任意部位即可拾取战利品的功能（已完成）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>添加其他可配置功能，如在床上睡觉、储物等</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>由 Zarra Studios 开发的模组</p>\n<p>请通过 Discord 或 GitHub 报告漏洞。</p>\n<p><strong>代码已开源（遵循 Apache 2.0 协议）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>在此查看 Huzai 制作的模组：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doomsday-decoration</a></p>\n<p><strong>想要编辑战利品表？请编辑此处以覆盖默认值：<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/doomsday-functionality-default-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/doomsday-functionality-default-datapack</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVd6GNpvtW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/939863205621137458.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fallmylinks.com%252fraiiiden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/more-links-ff69b4.svg\" alt=\"links\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/ZarraModpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Patreon-Support-orange.svg?logo=Patreon\" alt=\"Support\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopensource.org%252flicenses%252fApache-2.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache_2.0-blue.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
